      "spam": false,
      "value": "Strangely, I'm not seeing an option to edit.\nI would be removing the second paragraph about the grip animation (since animation overriding does that) and replacing it with 3rd person desktop camera support.\nVideos benefit incredibly from shots that aren't first person, which is only available now by asking a second player to record their view.",
