  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There is currently a lag between when a player receives voice and movement. A \"puppeteer\" mode or toggle that corrects that timing for players watching would open doors for live VR puppetry.\n\nSeparately, it would make my life incredibly easier to have a way to see how the analogue \"grip\" animation (that controls the puppet's jaw) is going to work with my puppet rigs before I import it into VRChat.",
